(662,"グルメ、店、縁結びの神社が集まるにぎやかな商店街。","A lively district gathering food, shops and a matchmaking shrine."),
(663,"九里橋商店街は高架線路に沿って広がります。屋上庭園には桜並木と屋台が並び、階下には飲食店と店舗がぎっしり。食べたいものも見たいものも一度に済みます。","The Kusatobashi district spreads along the elevated tracks. Rooftop gardens have rows of cherry trees and stalls, while below are packed restaurants and shops—everything you want to eat and see in one go."),
(664,"商店街には良縁を願う縁結びの神社があり、朱塗りの鳥居がビルの間にひっそりと立っています。買い物の前後に立ち寄ってお守りを求める人が大勢います。九里橋三丁目駅を出たら、人の流れに沿って進めば着きます。","The district has a matchmaking shrine for good fortune in love, its vermilion torii tucked between buildings. Many people drop in before or after shopping to buy an omamori charm. From Kusatobashi 3-chome station, just follow the crowd."),
(665,"グルメと店","Food and shops"),
(666,"屋上庭園の桜と屋台","Cherry trees and stalls in the rooftop garden"),
(667,"縁結びの神社","Matchmaking shrine"),
(668,"九里橋三丁目駅を出てすぐ","Right outside Kusatobashi 3-chome station"),
(669,"九里橋商店街の屋上庭園の桜と屋台","Cherry trees and stalls in the Kusatobashi rooftop garden"),
