(673,"川辺・四季","Riverside · Seasons"),
(674,"静かな川辺の遊歩道で、夕日と鉄橋を渡る列車が見られます。","A quiet riverside promenade with sunsets and trains crossing the iron bridge."),
(675,"多見瀨河畔公園は川岸に沿って続く静かな遊歩道です。広い川面に空が映り、石段が水辺まで続いていて、遠くへ行かなくてもぼんやり座れる場所が見つかります。遠くの鉄橋が川をまたぎ、電車がゆっくり渡っていく光景が、ここを代表する景色です。","Tomise Riverside Park is a quiet promenade along the riverbank. The wide river mirrors the sky and stone steps lead to the water, so a place to sit and daydream is never far. In the distance an iron bridge spans the river as trains cross slowly—the signature view here."),
(676,"おすすめは夕方。夕日が空と川面を桃色がかった橙に染め、列車のシルエットが橋の上をすべり、水面に映る影が静かに揺れます。春は川沿いの桜が満開になり、秋は紅葉が並び、一年を通して表情が変わります。多見瀨駅を降りたら、川岸に沿って歩けば着きます。","Evening is the best time: the sunset tints sky and river pink-orange, a train’s silhouette glides over the bridge, and its reflection sways gently on the water. Cherry blossoms line the banks in spring and maples in autumn, so the scene changes through the year. From Tomise station, simply walk along the river."),
(677,"川辺の遊歩道と石段、静かで散歩向き","Riverside promenade and stone steps—quiet and good for walks"),
(678,"夕日と鉄橋を渡る列車","Sunset and a train crossing the iron bridge"),
(679,"春は桜、秋は紅葉","Cherry blossoms in spring, autumn leaves in fall"),
